[[0,1390172,0,60,0,60,"2016-11-05T01:00:08","Broc_Lia","",[],"","Meet Peter Kadzic (\"ubiased\" justice department appointee to review new Hillary emails)","https://i.sli.mg/AD2cig.png","politics"],[1,6733503,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-05T01:12:11","RidinMyGoatCart","",[],"<p>SpiritCooking Tony and his buddy Peter. Oh boy.</p>"],[1,6734151,0,2,0,2,"2016-11-05T02:41:58","gazillions","",[],"<p>If it's true that there's 21 of them going down tomorrow, it's probably safe to assume he's one of them.</p>"],[2,6734215,6734151,1,0,1,"2016-11-05T02:50:28","Broc_Lia","",[],"<p>You mean the october surprise thing? I'd really like to think so, but it sounds way too good to be true. Here's hoping.</p>"],[3,6734309,6734215,0,0,0,"2016-11-05T03:01:57","GIF-lLL-S0NG","",[],"<p>It's November now. The october surprise was a honeypot. </p>"],[4,6734393,6734309,0,0,0,"2016-11-05T03:16:01","Broc_Lia","",[],"<p>It's probably fake, but someone was posting on one of the chans promising a game changing release of information on nov 5th (tomorrow) which is supposedly the delayed october surprise.</p>"],[1,6736279,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-05T11:58:51","voat5846","",[],"<p>So much collusion it is hard to keep track.</p>"],[2,6736284,6736279,0,0,0,"2016-11-05T11:59:29","Broc_Lia","",[],"<p>And it's <em>still</em> slightly easier to keep track of than gamergate, lol.</p>"]]
